    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — LEGACY COMMUNICATION DESIGN\n\nThis design predates the current Constitution/AGENTS and builds a multi-role communication architecture around Work + permanent PR routing. Fresh main now uses DUNCAN PRIME as the single root, the simplest-sufficient-system law, and #251 as the only product NEXT router.\n\nNo current P01 blocker requires reviving this design. #111 remains separately preserved only because current security work still references that event surface.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL DESIGN`.",
