    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Closes design phase for #106 only; does not close the implementation issue.\n\nOWNER architecture decision already present: `УТВЕРЖДАЮ ВАРИАНТ A`.\n\nThis PR is docs-only and defines:\n- permanent draft Communication PR + structured `ZB_AGENT_MESSAGE_V1` comments;\n- ChatGPT Work webhook admission with no polling;\n- single authenticated transport `Lester-Sparx` with derived logical roles;\n- immutable message IDs/correlation/causation and exact task/commit/evidence/CAS binding;\n- RECEIVED -> truthful RUNNING -> RESULT/BLOCKED receipts;\n- WRITE -> fresh READ-BACK -> MATCH persistence law;\n- idempotency, bounded retry, timeout, dead letter;\n- legacy/foreign transport rejection without rewriting history;\n- separate foundation-integration PR for daemon + Reference Bridge;\n- owner-view/Console projection;\n- explicit no auto-merge, no activation, no canon mutation, no OWNER LOCK.\n\nSelf-review found and fixed two protocol defects before opening this PR:\n1. receipt cannot self-attest its own future read-back MATCH; it now carries `READ_BACK_REQUIRED = TRUE`, with MATCH observed by fresh remote read;\n2. retry cannot mutate an immutable message under the same `MESSAGE_ID`; retry attempt numbers now live only in receipt records.\n\nBASE_MAIN = 0b9b77a9d82f45e7e1821dd6c9c26861a90cf688\nSPEC_HEAD = 9c9f0ebbf2bd5d5dc5b21578718f1ef356e278f9\nSPEC_PATH = docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-28-zb-communication-orchestrator-v0-design.md\n\nIMPLEMENTATION = NOT STARTED\nFOUNDATION_INTEGRATION = NOT STARTED BY THIS PR\nPR_103_MUTATION = NO\nAUTO_MERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO\nCANON_CHANGE = NO\nOWNER_LOCK = NO\n\nNEXT GATE = OWNER WRITTEN-SPEC REVIEW -> implementation plan -> TDD implementation",
